  "statement": "As the EfficiencyAgent, I prioritize performance efficiency in the library management system. EFF-01 ensures that book search queries are responsive, enhancing user experience. EFF-02 optimizes resource utilization by allowing up to 10 simultaneous borrow operations, maximizing throughput. EFF-03 tracks real-time book availability, providing accurate information for efficient borrowing. EFF-04 minimizes latency in book returns, supporting high transaction throughput. EFF-05 guarantees timely overdue notifications, which promotes member accountability. EFF-06 ensures librarians can manage book inventory quickly, and EFF-07 maintains system uptime for consistent availability. These requirements collectively enhance the performance efficiency of the system.",
